OL,3,GNEWSATown fan travels 4,000 miles for
OL,4,Afirst Portman Road match
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Ipswich Town fan has travelled more
OL,7,Fthan 4,000 miles to witness his first
OL,8,Fmatch at Portman Road after supporting
OL,9,Fthe club for 22 years.
OL,11,FMarc Ardisson flew over from his home
OL,12,Fin Nashville, Tennessee in the United
OL,13,FStates earlier in the week ahead of
OL,14,FTown's match against Aston Villa at
OL,15,F17:30 GMT.
OL,17,FHe became a fan after meeting an
OL,18,FIpswich family during a holiday in
OL,19,FOrlando, Florida, and in the summer
OL,20,Fdecided to set up his own supporters'
OL,21,Fclub in his home town.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
