OL,3,GNEWSATown fan travels 4,000 miles for
OL,4,Afirst Portman Road match
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday he was welcomed to the
OL,7,Fstadium so the club could present him
OL,8,Fwith the official supporters' club flag
OL,9,Fafter he gained enough members to be
OL,10,Frecognised, which Ardisson said left
OL,11,Fhim feeling "proud".
